  "contains_code": true,
  "description": "KPL（王者荣耀职业联赛）S/A/B 赛制，用于中国赛区。每组三个单循环（45 场），每轮积分清零并按名次重新分组（含卡位赛 BO7），赛季末 12 队双败 BO7 季后赛（16 场）加 7-10 名排位。每个赛段开始时随机抽签分三组：第一轮显示「一组/二组/三组」，第二轮起显示 S/A/B 组。底部「季后赛」按钮可展开完整 16 场对阵面板（轮次、日期、队徽、实时比分），绕开原生页面只有 8 个卡位的问题，赛后推送战报。中国赛区（含 K 甲、青训、新生成选手）统一使用 KPL 风格中文名，能力值不变。S/A/B 同级，无 S↔A 升降级；B↔K甲 升降级保留。\n\nKPL (King Pro League) S/A/B format for the CN region: three single round-robins per group (45 matches), per-round standings reset with regrouping (incl. BO7 card matches), a 12-team double-elimination BO7 playoff (16 matches) plus 7-10 placement games. Each split opens with a random draw into three groups (Group 1/2/3 in round 1, S/A/B from round 2). A Playoffs button opens a full 16-match bracket panel, working around the native 8-slot limit, with a daily report. S, A and B share one tier (no S-A relegation); B-to-K甲 promotion is kept.\n\n更新记录 / Changelog\n1.6.9 修挂名队混进季后赛（0-0 挂名队的场次差压过 0-5 真队）；改为真队优先排序，并作废旧版写进存档的脏席位快照。\n1.6.8 修「季后赛」按钮概率点不开（翻转动作被双输入通道抵消）；改为幂等置位，并修底栏重建后不重绑、面板失败即放弃。\n1.6.7 修「季后赛」面板空白且 × 关不掉（关闭按钮的绑定排在 16 张卡片建完之后）。\n1.6.6-1.6.4 修国际杯抽签：定位退避盲区、归一化只改最新年份、类型校验过严、B 组补槽被 finalize 挡住。\n1.6.0-1.6.3 支持 0.7.0 Expansion 与换帅；管理回合提速；游戏内 OVR 与名单评分一致。\n1.1.0-1.5.0 中国赛区中文名、S/A/B 同级、16 场季后赛面板与战报、2026 夏季真实大名单。\n\n1.6.9 fixes placeholder teams leaking into the playoffs (0-0 placeholders outranked a 0-5 real team); real teams now always outrank them, and stale snapshots are discarded.\n1.6.8 fixes the Playoffs button sometimes not opening (a toggle cancelled by two input channels); now idempotent.\n1.6.7 fixes the empty Playoffs panel and its dead X button.\n1.6.4-1.6.6 fix the international-cup draw (lookup blind spot, normalisation scope, over-strict type check, B-group back-fill).\n1.6.0-1.6.3 add 0.7.0 Expansion and manager-move support, faster turns, and in-game OVR matching the roster rating.\n1.1.0-1.5.0 add Chinese names, one tier for S/A/B, the 16-match playoff panel, and the real 2026 Summer rosters.\n\n建议与「KPL + Real LoL Teams」数据包搭配使用。Best used together with the KPL + Real LoL Teams data mod.",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-01",
